<item><title>Moroccan MPs push marketing reform to bring down food prices</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/ma/moroccan-mps-push-marketing-reform-to-bring-down-food-prices-ff341a/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/ma/moroccan-mps-push-marketing-reform-to-bring-down-food-prices-ff341a/</guid><category>Morocco</category><description>Lawmakers say some produce doubles or triples in price after leaving wholesale markets, with losses on tomatoes and potatoes reaching around 30%.</description><pubDate>Thu, 12 Nov 2026 22:00:03 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/ma.jpg" length="33258" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/ma.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
<item><title>Morocco cuts self-employed tax rate</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/ma/morocco-cuts-self-employed-tax-rate-08d6fa/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/ma/morocco-cuts-self-employed-tax-rate-08d6fa/</guid><category>Morocco</category><description>The government proposes lowering the tax rate for self-employed workers from 30% to 20% while introducing measures to prevent employer abuse.</description><pubDate>Thu, 12 Nov 2026 20:32:49 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/ma/morocco-cuts-self-employed-tax-rate-08d6fa/share.jpg" length="34606" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/ma/morocco-cuts-self-employed-tax-rate-08d6fa/share.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
<item><title>French firm Colas Rail wins €29 million Moroccan rail contract</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/ma/french-firm-colas-rail-wins-29-million-moroccan-rail-ae5106/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/ma/french-firm-colas-rail-wins-29-million-moroccan-rail-ae5106/</guid><category>Morocco</category><description>The railway operator ONCF has awarded Colas Rail work on track, catenary and civil engineering in the Casablanca area.</description><pubDate>Thu, 12 Nov 2026 16:13:06 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/ma.jpg" length="33258" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/ma.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
